{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-18_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-18",
  "title": "Hemorrheal Billows",
  "storyCode": "13-20",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-18_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5a5a134032271dcb1de5cfe0e8d3af01a57c5a2fd23e06b1666960547283fa98",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g1_shard_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Theresis."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vampire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If memory serves, I have some sort of role in your hypocritical 'Military Commission'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I haven't seen a war report from you in quite some time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nor have you attended any Commission meetings in quite some time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've always held the requisite command authority."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Command authority.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't need to command my offspring, they serve me naturally, they serve their court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then you need to manage them better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The war's end approaches, and your underlings need to play a more significant role. Their wanton behavior vexes me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The western front is wasting time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is necessary for the ritual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Without enough blood and tears, how are we supposed to gather enough material for the witchcraft?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You and Theresa told me about the ancient door you found, covered in scabs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is the source of all Sarkaz suffering, the origin of our fate, really behind that door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The preparations for the ritual are complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But one of the nodes, the town of Brentwood, is under attack by our enemies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you dispatching me to resolve these trifling nuisances for you, Theresis?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, that reminds me, oh revered 'Regent' of the Military Commission—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Since the Commission has noted this is such a <i>crucial</i> town, why did it not prepare any significant defense?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No shrouded casters, meat puppets, or any haphazardly bewitched, flesh-woven brutes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I indulged you and your sister on account of your dazzlingly powerful souls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Weak Sarkaz call you Regent, and the Confessarii have gathered around you, bringing Theresa back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Regent and the resurrected 'King of Sarkaz', what a fascinating pair of siblings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But all of this owes to your actions, your power, not your... status."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "<i>Power.</i>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have blessed this battlefield in order to cast the grandest of curses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I, in my benevolence as head of one of the oldest of the courts, have awakened the power hidden within the blood of the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And so, Theresis, have you felt it? Does my boon delight you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, but how much power can be drawn from your mixed blood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The end is near, it's making you restless."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Conceal your weakness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or shall I say, do you need a reminder or two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will complete the final part of the ritual for you, proud Regent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it is not in service of the narrow ambitions of you and your sister, eyes always fixed on that nomadic city bearing the false name of Kazdel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just another resting place in that painful river."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa is ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Shard will soon unleash a power that Victoria could never imagine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The skeleton is waiting in the hub outside the encampment, you can go from there to Brentwood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exciting, isn't it...? Theresis, you always wear such dull, lifeless faces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've seen it. A black light rising over the horizon, like a wall of obsidian, that will eventually found a real city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresis",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_062",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh... You mock my impatience, but isn't silence the best way to conceal your deepest thoughts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If only I could go back in time to see it for myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you really can retrieve the power that could reshape this great land, that which the Sarkaz first reached out to touch... 'Originium'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then I will, on your behalf, spread the name of Kazdel to every scrap of land I set foot on."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Prince, the drifting of the Feranmut is about to end, and we will soon arrive at the waystation near Brentwood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The town has been occupied by Victorians, and they are clearing out your creations."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Creations?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those mindless insects are nothing more than a few drops of residual blood carelessly spilled by children of the Crimson Court while painting runes on crystals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let the Victorians celebrate their 'victory'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My mistake. Forgive me, Your Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are called Ulšulah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Yes, Your Highness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your blood is mixed with too much alcohol. I can forgive hedonism and indulgence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But your hesitation disappoints."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can wash those away for you, 'Major'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I am grateful for your benevolence, My Prince, but I can... handle myself. I... will endeavor to do better."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ulšulah... Ulšulah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ulšulah the Time-Stealer. A popular household story."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah, 'Ulšulah' has taken the reins of this particular skeleton. Amusing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a coincidence, Your Highness. When I took the name, I never thought I would really be any kind of hero—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ulšulah was a coward."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He couldn't even look directly into the eyes of this Feranmut, daring only to hide in the turbulent currents it stirred up, waking some of the people immersed in illusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So I sent him on such a mission, of course, 'to save many people.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it? Have recognized me at last?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Prince, we are nearly there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We may encounter some illusions—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No need to remind me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've dealt with this one far more than you ever have."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) You worked hard to build this ashen Kazdel, and the Sarkaz have a home again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) But doesn't its diminutive size infuriate you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) The outblood invaders deprived the Teekaz of their ancestral land. So, you started to compromise, shrinking and distorting that which stands for your home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) To a plain, a circle of fields, until you can only call it your city, your village."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) This is the starting point of Sarkaz weakness."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) And now, I look back from the endpoint."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The illusions are over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This skeleton has returned to its lair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Prince... it is my duty to remind you that the forces in control of the Brentwood core Arts Circle are nearby."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They may not be aware that the skeleton leaves a trace. Our return may have been exposed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your power is undeniable, but among our enemies, there may be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have our enemies destroyed the ritual nodes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The battlefield Arts Circles cast by this skeleton were merely the tendrils, extremities of the Crimson Court's grasp."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In any case, since we've come to the end..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Allow me to personally stand as the center of this most ancient ritual—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Farchaser', eh? The crowned hunter, our first King of Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If your soul still lingers among the myriad after thousands of years—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you watch us yet, the descendants of your lost homeland..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If those distant legends that have been distorted and painted over are not lies—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let the suffering in that cradle descend again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let us... reclaim the lost fate of the Teekaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...As we thought, the Victorians are attacking here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We will do what we can to buy you time to complete the ritual, My Prince."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Victorians? Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresis, you really have surprised me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, no, girl called Ulšulah, we are not facing any such 'Victorians'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our guests deserve to witness this moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Another pureblood, still a young knell."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And the usurper 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No matter who they are, the Military Commission's plan must be executed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll strengthen my connection with the Feranmut as much as possible, in order to prevent them from reaching this place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulšulah",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1067_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My Prince, please—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have no standing from which to advise me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, I do so want to see—What cliches will they spout at me this time? What moments of despair can they show me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now then, 'Major', you stay here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This dispensable work of yours is over."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g2_giantmonsterspine"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Ruin'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you still toying with these pathetic words, these false curses, Banshee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why don't you face the power that truly belongs to you, the power gathered in your blood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't the elegy you can sing now so much more melodious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alas, you are silent, never to open your mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vampire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it you are trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is no ritual recorded in Sarkaz literature."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it... calling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's... I think I see a... 'seed'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... you're trying to awaken it with millennia-old witchcraft, to nourish it with the Arts Circles on the battlefields, and control it with the storm over The Shard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You must be stopped!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll destroy Londinium! It'll be nothing but a heap of rubble full of Originium!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, not only that... at this scale, with this much power... I can even see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The revenge of the Sarkaz will drag all of Terra into the abyss."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...'Revenge'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Cautus, you still claim to be the King of Sarkaz, but your views are so biased."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Two hundred years ago, a coalition of Terran nations destroyed Kazdel once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And now, do you think we would bring pain and destruction to Victoria as simple vengeance for their conquest two centuries ago?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh... I am disappointed once again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Black Crown lingers over your head, and indeed, this is yet another ridiculous thing wrought by the 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Killing an enemy and butchering a country, burying a city and annihilating a culture, these things are not different, for the Sarkaz, these are far from enough to be called resistance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've come to Londinium, this outblood capital, not for any kind of 'retaliation'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Seed'? Not a bad description."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Watch and see what sights this seed will bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're a narrow-minded one, Vampire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No flowery words can change the nature of what it is you're doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You call me silent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rest assured, Vampire, you will hear me speak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Fetters, fall heavy on your body.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What? So easy—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—No! It's not!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "His blood!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's going to complete the ritual!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...! The incantation left in Londinium was just destroyed in that instant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's happened in Londinium?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya, end this battle quickly, I feel some kind of—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't be so hasty, honored guests."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's just such a great opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In the sight of the first curse—perhaps today, we..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sanguinarch of Vampires",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_410_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can bid farewell to the last 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
